  <!-- EN: "All birds are Archotech surveillance drones!" A wild-eyed conspiracy theorist claimed the world was a simulation and 15G towers controlled everyone inside it. Infected by the theorist's paranoia, his followers donated everything they had to build an isolated underground city beyond the Storyteller's reach.\n\nTwist! The theorist was simply a cult leader, keeping his followers isolated and underground to profit from whatever they dug out of the earth.\n\nShocking twist! And RAAAAGE! While everyone else survived on rationed food and recycled water, their prophet was caught importing wine and a luxury bathtub. After a brief civil war, he was burned alive, and survivors broke for the surface.\n\nAnother shocking twist! Having spent years sealed underground, they had long since fallen beneath the Storyteller's attention. Then came an unspeakable worm that told them to look at the horizon, where parts of the world had not finished loading. Shaken and utterly disillusioned, the survivors accepted the worm's offer: the worm would take their places in the simulation, while they themselves would be erased from it forever.\n\nYears later, the city was still running, except it was now called "Neo-Yokohama" and its residents were now pale beauties who greeted each other with "Konnichiwa".\n\nFinal twist! None of this is the faction's lore. I just really like Ninja Slayer. -->
  <Anneli_Faction_NeoYokohama.description>“所有鸟类都是超凡智能的监控无人机！”某个有点疯癫的阴谋论者宣称，这个世界其实是一场模拟，而15G信号塔正在控制其中的每一个人。被他的偏执妄想所感染，他的追随者们捐出了自己的一切，一同建造了一座与世隔绝的地下都市，来逃离故事叙述者的掌控。\n\n反转！这个阴谋论者其实只是个邪教头子。他把信徒们隔绝在地下，再靠他们从泥里挖出来的东西牟利。\n\n惊天反转！加上暴怒！当其他人还在靠配给食品和循环水度日时，他们的先知居然在偷偷进口葡萄酒和豪华浴缸。一场短暂的内战随即爆发，先知被活活烧死，而幸存者则冲向地表。\n\n惊天再反转！在地下封闭了这么多年，他们早已淡出了故事叙述者的注意。随后，一条不可名状的蠕虫出现了，让他们望向远方的地平线，结果某些场景甚至还没有加载完成。震惊而彻底幻灭的幸存者接受了蠕虫的提议：蠕虫将代替他们留在这个模拟世界里，而他们自身则会被从模拟中彻底抹除。\n\n多年以后，这座城市依旧运转着，只不过它现在叫作“新横滨”，居民也变成了一群脸色苍白的美少女，见面时会互相问候“Konnichiwa”。\n\n最终反转！这个派系故事和派系一毛钱关系没有，我只是很喜欢《忍者杀手》而已。</Anneli_Faction_NeoYokohama.description>
